{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Genki Break! is a fast-paced 3D fighting game all about movement and stamina management!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Genki Break! features an 8-way walk, 4-way dashes, and directional-based movesets along with a unique stamina system. <br><br>Don't feel like losing? Press all 3 buttons and spend a chunk of stamina to regain a sliver of health and get back in the fight using <strong>ADRENALINE RUSH</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid overspending stamina or risk becoming <strong>STAMINA BROKEN</strong>. A state in which any knockdown becomes fatal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">End in a round while <strong>STAMINA BROKEN</strong> or in <strong>ADRENALINE RUSH</strong>, you'll enter <strong>STAMINA PENALTY</strong> for the next round. <strong>STAMINA PENALTY</strong> reduces your maximum stamina.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/AdrenalineRushEx.gif?t=1753859618\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>It features a cast of 4 unique fighters: Alex, Lumber, Sho, and Mike!</strong>  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alex, a boxer with evasive movement and quick strikes.     <br>    <br>Lumber, a pro-wrestler with heavy hitting attacks and even heavier throws!     <br>    <br>Sho, a martial artist equipped with a nice balance of powerful and fast strikes.     <br>    <br>Mike, a street brawler with advancing strikes and brutal offense.     </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/CharactersGenkiBreakCrushed4x3.png?t=1753859618\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Modes include: Online Versus (Lobbies), Local Versus, 4-Player, Arcade, Survival, and Training.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Online Versus: Play online in lobbies with ROLLBACK NETCODE!  <br> <br>Local Versus: Duke it out side-by-side, one on one. <br> <br>4-Player: A chaotic 1v1v1v1 arena battle, last one standing wins! <br> <br>Arcade: Face all 4 fighters leading up to a climatic final boss to win the Genki Break! tournament!  <br> <br>Survival: Fight an endless onslaught on increasingly difficult fighters.  <br> <br>Training: Hone your skills, analyze the data, and lab combos! Featuring a hitbox viewer, frame data, and various other options to give you all the tools you need to practice the game! <br> <br> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/extras/4PlayerEx.gif?t=1753859618\" /></div>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817720?t=1753859618","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/cc9302cbab98e68e5d0a9670e9b71b274ada2413/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753859618","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/68ea6689a6090524f8b9ec3038c624517b79d960/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753859618","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817720/68ea6689a6090524f8b9ec3038c624517b79d960/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753859618","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen P